Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.31,0:00:04.60,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(1048,666.8)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur4}ZAFT軍 直布羅陀基地
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:20.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹這種事 幹這種事的傢伙們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.80,0:00:21.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Logos
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.42,0:00:25.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.88,0:00:33.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  住手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:37.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明什麼都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.86,0:00:39.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是  那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.09,0:00:44.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:52.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真？ 真
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:00:57.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.26,0:00:59.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你做惡夢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.25,0:01:00.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:08.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.43,0:01:19.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭和梅琳　被我…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是敵人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.47,0:01:22.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,背叛了 真
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.01,0:01:24.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:28.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 那我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:30.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是你做的惡夢嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.88,0:01:35.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我下手就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.69,0:01:38.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你太善良了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.43,0:01:40.50,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是軟弱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.63,0:01:43.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣什麼都保護不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.79,0:01:47.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以Heaven's Base戰的功績
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:50.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,授予真 飛鳥星雲勛章
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.07,0:02:00.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 這是第二枚了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.61,0:02:02.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太出色了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.09,0:02:03.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:08.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,此外將這個授予真 飛鳥和雷 查 巴勒路
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.57,0:02:12.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.61,0:02:13.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不滿意嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 怎麼會 沒有的事
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:17.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:24.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我們信賴你們力量的証據
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.96,0:02:28.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請以此為傲 不辜負此刻
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,今後也要盡心盡力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:40.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不勝光榮 必將盡力做到最好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:43.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我…不 本人也會努力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:50.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.57,0:02:51.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們先告退了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:53.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:55.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜 真
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.81,0:02:57.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:01.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真厲害啊 真
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:02.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到第二枚了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.32,0:03:03.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:06.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你的不予置評讓人有點膽寒啊 塔利雅
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:08.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓真和雷當上FAITH
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原本就做好準備被你責問了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:18.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今還說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:21.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想說的話有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.64,0:03:25.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但都不是能隨便說的 就沒提了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.35,0:03:28.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不想聽的話就別管我了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼叫不想聽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:36.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擊墜阿斯蘭 薩拉和梅琳 霍克的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.85,0:03:39.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我還不能接受
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.28,0:03:41.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我也知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.58,0:03:42.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.27,0:03:42.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.39,0:03:43.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.87,0:03:47.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,查明羅德 吉普利爾的所在了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.09,0:03:50.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡潘塔利亞情報部傳來的報告
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.86,0:03:53.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡潘塔利亞?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:55.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那他在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.74,0:03:57.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:53.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.11,0:05:55.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾去找賽蘭?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.99,0:05:57.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 不會有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.39,0:06:01.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且似乎ZAFT也已經知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.02,0:06:07.90,Title SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}{\blur5}黃金的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.22,0:06:07.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡潘塔利亞已經有艦隊出發前往初島
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:08.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.76,0:06:10.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總之 我們要求交出他本人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.97,0:06:17.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Heaven's Base戰他有責任
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而從已知的各種證詞看來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他的罪狀是不可推脫的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:27.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對其的包庇行為絕對不可饒恕
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.19,0:06:33.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡潘塔利亞已有艦隊攜此要求出動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:37.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以防萬一 我們也要採取非常行動
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.71,0:06:40.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為先頭 Minerva立即出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.55,0:06:44.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦…現在出發嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:47.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們若不表明我們是認真的根本無法交涉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:49.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva以速度著稱吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:54.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,連續作戰實在抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.21,0:06:57.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但拜託了 庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.72,0:07:01.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布不僅以其高度的軍事技術為傲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.35,0:07:05.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也擁有Mass Driver這條通天的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.39,0:07:04.23,注释SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Mass Driver  質量加速器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很在意那個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:12.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,若吉普利爾掌握了奧布的軍力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:15.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和月球的聯合軍會合
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:20.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,PLANT本土也可能再次受到威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.81,0:07:26.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能忘記他才是Blue Cosmos的盟主
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,您是說奧布會幫助他?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:32.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,現在他就在奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.78,0:07:37.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個國家不可能不知道我們在找他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.61,0:07:39.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布是Logos陣營的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.35,0:07:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡的Blue Cosmos
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才沒回應議長的號召
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.13,0:07:48.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布在Junius 7事件之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.64,0:07:51.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是作為友國的親密國家
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想到這點就很遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.61,0:07:59.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們在這件事上一步也不能退讓
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.36,0:08:02.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再容忍Logos在暗地裡活動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次一定要逮住他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.08,0:08:06.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.27,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\blur4.3}奧布領地 初島
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:13.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼不下出擊命令
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.12,0:08:16.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們不是都逼到領海前面來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:18.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又來初島?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.50,0:08:20.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 聽說是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.38,0:08:23.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 政府沒有任何表示嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:26.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 好像報導也被管制了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:30.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要完成所有作業還需要多久
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:33.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎 電子系統 補給
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.27,0:08:37.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各方面加起來 最快也要兩天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.99,0:08:40.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能盡快嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:43.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,趕不上的話就沒用了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.92,0:08:52.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.03,0:08:57.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂 在那裡瞎忙也沒用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:08:59.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖躺著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.20,0:09:01.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.60,0:09:04.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.96,0:09:06.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:09.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說還不一定會開戰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:13.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要魯莽行事 等待烏納特等人的應對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.42,0:09:15.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是 奇薩卡上校也是此意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.88,0:09:24.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微有點腦子的人都看得出來
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.80,0:09:22.67,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(974.4,665.2)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur5}奧布本島 賽蘭官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:26.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那狄蘭達爾的騙局
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.66,0:09:28.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:33.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要是世界受其支配 你們也沒有容身之處了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.07,0:09:38.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過不用擔心 我們也很快就能反擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.67,0:09:44.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只要讓他回天上我也上天奏起Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:47.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一切就結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.34,0:09:48.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Requiem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.99,0:09:52.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要想撐到那時候 現在該怎麼做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:56.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聰明的你早該心知肚明了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.67,0:09:57.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特 艾瑪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.95,0:10:01.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布政府發出答覆文
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.33,0:10:03.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發到揚聲器上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.34,0:10:08.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我代表奧布政府 答覆通告
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:09.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.77,0:10:11.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貴艦要求引渡的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:16.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅德 吉普利爾此人不存在於我國內
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:18.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.77,0:10:20.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.41,0:10:21.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,行了 安靜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.90,0:10:24.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,此外 這種武力恫嚇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.51,0:10:30.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是對我主權國家尊嚴的侵害行為
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:32.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深表遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.23,0:10:36.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8}因此 要求你們立即退兵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:34.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢如此愚弄我們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.22,0:10:37.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以為這麼說我們就不敢打了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:40.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種…這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.54,0:10:44.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這種情勢下怎麼可能被接受
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:46.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,看來別無他法了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.79,0:10:51.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今我們沒心思陪他們演這種鬧劇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:56.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,既然以這種虛情假意回應我們的信任
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.72,0:11:00.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我憑著正義和對和平的熱切期望
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:02.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,誓要與此對抗到底
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.72,0:11:05.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要把羅德 吉普利爾從奧布揪出來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:16.95,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(792,665.2)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur5}奧布近海
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:14.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Fury 作戰計畫開始
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.25,0:11:17.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,紅色狀態發佈  紅色狀態發佈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:19.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認攻擊目標
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.38,0:11:21.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布本土 賽蘭官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.53,0:11:24.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,國防本部 奧布行政府
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.83,0:11:26.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,法多姆隊ASH 狄路隊GOOhN
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.09,0:11:28.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備完成
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.49,0:11:29.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全機打開武器保險
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.40,0:11:32.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標雖是羅德 吉普利爾
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.45,0:11:35.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對勾結Logos的奧布政府也不用客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.61,0:11:38.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迅速除掉或捕獲他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.89,0:11:42.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,努力把平民的損失降低到最低限度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:45.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT艦上MS出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:49.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ASH GOOhN DINN BABI GOUF
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:52.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布軍呢 怎麼部署的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,避難情況呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.74,0:11:56.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒動靜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.62,0:11:59.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也沒發出避難警報
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:05.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不僅如此 初島海域的事態似乎也未告知民眾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.56,0:12:07.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:18.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布本土受到轟炸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.14,0:12:33.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,目標似乎是賽蘭官邸
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.76,0:12:35.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦還不能出擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:39.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 引擎還沒搞定呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.35,0:12:43.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵MS群展開 數量40 正在接近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:46.84,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(1035.2,662)}{\fad(500,500)}{\blur5}初島 奧布軍 國防本部
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.84,0:12:46.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾我上校 敵軍正步步逼近
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.24,0:12:49.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為何還未發佈任何命令
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.84,0:12:50.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,市民的避難也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.40,0:12:52.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續呼叫行政府
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:54.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,賽蘭在想什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.93,0:12:58.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 怎麼會變這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:03.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明明說了他不在為什麼還打來
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:05.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為知道是謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.40,0:13:09.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,政府為何發佈那種愚蠢的答覆
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.25,0:13:13.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是以前Archangel來的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:15.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,政府和情況都和當時不同了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:25.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦 總之我們也採取防衛措施
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.27,0:13:30.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,護衛艦群出動 開始迎擊 MS隊出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:32.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不能允許他們繼續前進
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.69,0:13:34.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一第二護衛艦群出動
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.98,0:13:37.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,立即驅逐敵軍威脅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.43,0:13:39.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,MS隊出擊開始
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:43.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,第一到第四小隊到伊邪那岐海岸防線
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿瑪基 Murasame隊能出動吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.91,0:13:48.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:49.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:53.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長  Sky Grasper借我一用
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.39,0:13:55.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.88,0:13:57.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕只有我們也得出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.82,0:14:07.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這太胡鬧了 用Sky Grasper
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:10.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布正面臨再度被戰火煎熬的危險
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:18.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經什麼都等不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:21.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:23.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奇薩卡上校
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.93,0:14:24.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艾莉卡小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.04,0:14:25.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 阿瑪基
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.26,0:14:27.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,機體先借用了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:31.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說了等不了 放開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:33.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 跟我一起來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:34.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:36.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣坐視不管的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不如和國土一起化為焦炭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正因如此會讓人很困擾才叫你跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.05,0:14:45.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦 放開
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:46.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.32,0:14:48.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想去當然可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.38,0:14:52.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不過還是先聽聽烏茲米閣下的話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:54.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親的?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:57.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對 遺言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.67,0:15:03.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡刻著字吧 讀讀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:11.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,願這扇大門永不打開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:14.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這扇門打開的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:19.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,意味著奧布再次被戰火包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.52,0:15:21.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.85,0:15:27.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而這就是烏茲米閣下被封印的遺言
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.83,0:15:39.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,金黃色的MS
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.81,0:15:41.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:43.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.16,0:15:47.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有一天希望得到力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.54,0:15:50.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為答覆我贈與你此物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.03,0:15:54.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,未能傳授你的事還有許多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.90,0:15:57.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只要你願意學習
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:16:04.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,就必能從愛戴支持你的人們身上學得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.97,0:16:08.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因此 我只贈與你此物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.11,0:16:10.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,力量單單是力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,貪得無厭誠然不可取
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:15.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,以卵擊石亦非明智之舉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.69,0:16:20.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,守護之劍 現在需要的話拿起它吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:25.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是為了你認為必須完成的事業
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.97,0:16:27.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:32.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我真心祈願你永遠不會聽到我這段話
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:38.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也許對已打開這扇門的你是無法傳達的願望
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.83,0:16:41.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請幸福地活下去 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.89,0:16:47.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,父親 父親
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.38,0:16:49.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,坐上Akatsuki吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.43,0:16:51.99,注释SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Akatsuki 拂曉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.79,0:16:53.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Akatsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.77,0:17:09.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ORB-01  Akatsuki
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:12.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,系統啟動 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:15.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈　Akatsuki出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.87,0:17:33.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新松原第二防線被突破
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:37.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本土防線全面崩潰
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.96,0:17:39.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不重整旗鼓會全滅
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.40,0:17:43.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那快幹啊 趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:45.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正是在等您的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.27,0:17:49.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,說這種話 再吃敗仗可就全怪你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.49,0:17:54.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,援軍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不重整防線的話會全線崩潰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:04.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,首先控制國防本部 重整戰線
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.60,0:18:06.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,一號小隊跟我來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:07.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剩下的去防線
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.10,0:18:08.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.35,0:18:13.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,曾我上校 海岸上空出現新的友軍部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.24,0:18:14.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.81,0:18:18.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,識別信號是Takemikazuchi搭載機的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.05,0:18:19.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:26.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還有未知MS一台 與Murasame一起朝這裡來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:28.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,金黃色的…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我是烏茲米 納拉 阿斯哈之女
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:34.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.21,0:18:36.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,國防本部聽得見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:41.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,事出突然也許令人懷疑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.43,0:18:44.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我想和指揮官說話 請…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:46.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是你來啦 我的甜心 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.17,0:18:56.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的女神 指揮官是我 是我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.76,0:18:58.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尤拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:03.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你承認我為奧布聯合首長國真正的代表首相
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:08.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,當然當然當然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:10.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我當然知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.20,0:19:12.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,她是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:15.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那以此權限下令
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:21.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,將士們立即以叛國罪逮捕拘禁尤拉 羅馬
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:24.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請允許我奉命拘禁您
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.84,0:19:29.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡…卡嘉莉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.24,0:19:42.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,從尤拉嘴裡打聽出吉普利爾的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.13,0:19:44.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,烏納特應該是在行政府吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.89,0:19:45.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,打開通訊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.45,0:19:49.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧布全軍現在開始歸入我指揮 明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:50.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.41,0:19:54.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,殘存Astray隊到孝光方集結
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:57.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,分兩小隊Murasame掩護上空 保護國土
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.52,0:20:00.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請大家助我一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.94,0:20:04.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.88,0:20:06.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,多茲隊中彈 撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.08,0:20:09.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,12區域海岸線 遭到反撲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.07,0:20:12.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.05,0:20:15.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才明明已經全線崩潰
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.71,0:20:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:18.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,再派2個小隊左右的GOUF過去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:23.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這國家也該老老實實束手就擒了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.95,0:20:24.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:26.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,8點方向 Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.57,0:20:28.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,距離20
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.86,0:20:30.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,吉普利爾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.33,0:20:32.99,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎還未發現
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:35.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎抵抗得非常頑強
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:38.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.22,0:20:42.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不用3人出場 我就夠了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:45.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:47.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.03,0:20:52.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.34,0:20:54.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.43,0:20:58.56,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,要打奧布的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:01.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,也得由我來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.15,0:21:04.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.35,0:21:07.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確認全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,開始出擊程序
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:11.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,閘門打開
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.87,0:21:12.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.59,0:21:14.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線清空
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.02,0:21:16.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Destiny 請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:20.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥  Destiny出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.93,0:21:27.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:29.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是他…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是本人自願的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:32.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:35.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真以FAITH的權限志願出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:38.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也以相同權限予以認可
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.62,0:21:41.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請艦長理解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.02,0:21:47.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.22,0:21:50.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉小姐 請小心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:52.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT的援兵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.69,0:21:53.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.79,0:23:25.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基拉認識
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:28.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉認識
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.94,0:23:30.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 真也認識
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.17,0:23:35.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而在此時 他最熟悉的是他自己
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.48,0:23:38.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,鍥而不捨的夢想現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.73,0:23:40.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,…化作新的力量重生
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.38,0:23:45.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下集 機動戰士高達SEED Destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.18,0:23:47.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,自由與正義
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.38,0:23:50.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,化作一陣風吧 DOM
